  "title": "丐帮",
  "html": "<h2 class=\"ws-h1\">基本信息</h2><p class=\"ws-p\">墨门行者，人数众多，势力极广，号称「天下第一大帮」，由来已不得考证，帮众以裘褐为衣,以跂蹻为服,日夜不休,以自苦为极。</p><p class=\"ws-p\">特点：以拳脚棍法为主，攻击效果突出</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/XGPxb4AarokBU7xuHvnciufAnpe.png\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"121\" height=\"373\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><h2 class=\"ws-h1\">通用攻略</h2><p class=\"ws-p\">莽</p><p class=\"ws-source\">内容整理自飞书《武神MUD2手册》· <a href=\"https://ucn595zz2fou.feishu.cn/wiki/SNR0wO6jzigiUbkBkExcdj9Wnwg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">查看原文</a></p>",
